## Dataset

**Source:** [Kaggle – Retail Store Inventory and Demand Forecasting](https://www.kaggle.com/dsv/11895299)

The dataset contains approximately 76,000 records covering January 2022 through January 2024.

It includes:
- Store and product identifiers
- Product categories and regions
- Inventory levels
- Units sold and units ordered
- Estimated demand
- Promotional activity
- Pricing and competitor pricing
- Weather and seasonal information

**Important:** This is a synthetic dataset. Findings demonstrate analytical methods and should not be interpreted as verified results from an actual retail business.

