## Reproducing the Project

1. Download the dataset from the Kaggle source listed above.
2. Import the dataset into Microsoft SQL Server.
3. Create or use the `dbo.Sales_Data` table.
4. Rename all columns with _ in place of all spaces.
5. Run the SQL scripts in the SQL folder.
5. Open the Power BI report.
6. Configure its SQL Server DirectQuery connection to your database.

